{
  "verdict": "allowed",
  "section": "34",
  "quote": "The tenant is responsible for the repair of undue damage to the rental unit or residential complex caused by the wilful or negligent conduct of the tenant, another occupant of the rental unit or a person permitted in the residential complex by the tenant.",
  "reason": "The clause mirrors section 34 of the Residential Tenancies Act, 2006, which makes the tenant responsible for repairing undue damage caused wilfully or negligently by the tenant, an occupant, or a guest. Because the clause is consistent with the Act rather than contrary to it, it is permitted and not void under section 4."
}

